01:16:15,000 --> 01:16:21,000
Santa Sangre (Spanish pronunciation: [ˈsãn̪.t̪a ˈsãŋ.ɡɾe], 'Holy Blood') is a 1989 surrealist psychological horror film
directed by Alejandro Jodorowsky and written by Jodorowsky along with Claudio Argento and Roberto Leoni.

11
01:23:52,500 --> 01:23:58,500
It stars Axel Jodorowsky, Adán Jodorowsky, Teo Jodorowsky,
Blanca Guerra, Thelma Tixou, and Guy Stockwell.

12
01:31:30,000 --> 01:31:36,000
An international co-production of Mexico and Italy, the film is set in Mexico, and tells the story
of Fénix, a boy who grew up in a circus and his struggle with childhood trauma.

13
01:39:07,500 --> 01:39:13,500
