the 500 Greatest Movies of All Time.

14
01:46:45,000 --> 01:46:51,000
The film explores themes of suicide, mexico city,
mexico, elephant, funeral, circus.

15
01:54:22,500 --> 01:54:28,500
The tone is lighthearted and dark and emotional.
